{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a936f1d2-b47b-893d-b849-9309fdd47642",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:42:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sal Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:39:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Greg. Sal Iannuccilli. I'm a homeowner here in Newport. Want to widen driveway, and somebody said I need a curb cut permit. That right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Depends. Are you changing where the driveway meets the street, or just making the paved area wider inside your property line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um. Both, maybe? Right now it's one car wide. I want two cars side by side. So the opening at the street gets wider too. I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then yeah, if the opening at the curb gets wider, that's a curb cut, and you'd need a permit for that. Widening just the back part might be separate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:39:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so two permits? Or one? [pause] Sorry, hang on, I got the map here, trying to fold it back up. [line breaks up] Old fashioned way, never goes back right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. You're on speaker, right? You're a little hard to hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:40:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, speakerphone, I got hands full. That better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Better. So, one application usually covers the curb cut. The driveway surface itself, we'd look at when you apply. Public works may weigh in on the curb part, since that's city right of way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:40:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, city right of way. That's the sidewalk? Or the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The strip between your property line and the road. Sidewalk, grass, curb, all that. You own the driveway, but the curb and that strip are the city's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:40:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. Okay. I thought curb was mine. So what's the fee? For the curb cut."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:40:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the number in front of me, and I don't want to throw out the wrong one. It's on the fee schedule, and the permit desk can tell you when you file. I can have them call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:41:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I'll look it up. Where's that schedule? On the website?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:41:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Should be on the city site under inspections, fees. Or stop by the counter at City Hall, they'll hand you the application and the schedule both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:41:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And I need drawing? Like of driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:41:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a simple sketch. Show the house, the lot lines, the current driveway, and the new width. Measurements, nothing fancy. Your map might help, if it's a plot plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:41:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's from the closing, I think. Survey. So that's the plot, right? Or is plot different from survey?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Close enough. A survey works fine. Just mark the new part on a copy, not the original."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Copy. Okay. Not the original. Got it. I think I got it. Curb cut permit, sketch, fee, city strip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:41:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Counter's open till the afternoon today, and you can come in tomorrow too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks, Greg. Folding this thing now, finally."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good luck with it. Bye now."
    }
  ],
